Before you answer, read each spoke back as a sentence — centre, then rel, then label — and check it is actually true and actually a property. If it reads like a chapter heading instead, replace it. Then check the first beat is the centre, every spoke has its own beat, and the narration fields together contain {{.MinWords}}-{{.MaxWords}} words, targeting {{.TargetWords}}.
